{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20331","headline":"三原李氏园宴集 · 张籍","name":"三原李氏园宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮春天早热，邑居苦嚣烦。\n言从君子乐，乐彼李氏园。\n园中有草堂，池引泾水泉。\n开户西北望，远见嵯峨山。\n借问主人翁，北州佐戎轩。\n仆夫守旧宅，爲客侍华筵。\n高怀有余兴，竹树芳且鲜。\n倾我所持觞，尽日共留连。\n疎拙不偶俗，常喜形体闲。\n况来幽栖地，能不重叹言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}